{"id":"95d5a7c3d486f284","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-pa-provable.md","title":"PA Provable","display":"df-pa-provable — PA Provable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-pa-provable","aliases":["89-df-pa-provable"],"display":"df-pa-provable — PA Provable","depends_on":["[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-pa-provable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-pa-provable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pa-provable — PA Provable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"841985de31202f85\" href=\"?note=841985de31202f85\" title=\"89-df-provability-predicate\">89-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"86ad48bbd1843ed6\" href=\"?note=86ad48bbd1843ed6\" title=\"89-df-peano-arithmetic\">89-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\)</span> 是 PA 的数值证明检查关系。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PAProv}:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\to\\{\\text{true},\\text{false}\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PAProv}:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\to\\{\\text{true},\\text{false}\\}\\)</span> 为下述定义的元层谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pa\\text{-}provable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PAProv}(\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\ ((y,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pa\\text{-}provable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PAProv}(\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\ ((y,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 2 章，印刷页 44–45；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n这是一元元语言谓词，等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\varphi\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\varphi\\)</span>；对象语言中相应句子是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"86ad48bbd1843ed6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PAProv}:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\to\\{\\text{true},\\text{false}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pa\\text{-}provable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PAProv}(\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\ ((y,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})","display":false}],"bytes":1118,"backlinks":[{"id":"8f382173effd5662","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PAProv}$ is the predicate from [[89-df-pa-provable]]."},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-338","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-pa-provable]]"}],"outgoing":["841985de31202f85","86ad48bbd1843ed6"]}